  Under the hypotheses of \Cref{thm:adelic_linearSystem_inf_overlap_eq}
  (\(D \le D'\), \(D' - D\) supported on the overlap), the window map
  \(L(D')/L(D) \to \Gamma(V, \struct{C}(D'))/\Gamma(V, \struct{C}(D))\)
